TODO.md: «A take that does not play on late in the long page test (buffered at readyState 1), and the WAV fallback that does not resume a take asked to play». The fallback set the WAV and never played it; it could not ask the element, since Chrome pauses a failed element silently before its error is heard (measured: a capture listener saw it playing, the handler paused, no pause event between). The play asked for is now the events': a play event sets it, a pause event ends it, a new take loaded without A/B clears it. A take asked to play, its sound all here, short of playing with its time standing for 4 s: loaded again in place and asked once more (said in the console); a second time paused and said; a slow line waits as before. stepTake's play says a refusal instead of swallowing it. The new toast in the six languages. Suite (suite-1361.part).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 tools/console/app.js            | 36 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++--
 tools/console/heresy-i18n-be.js |  4 ++++
 tools/console/heresy-i18n-el.js |  4 ++++
 tools/console/heresy-i18n-es.js |  4 ++++
 tools/console/heresy-i18n-it.js |  4 ++++
 tools/console/heresy-i18n-ru.js |  4 ++++
